// (#1039) THE VISIBILITY QUEUE (clean_vis_queue.glsl; llcleanvisqueuevk.cpp): the hit-shading split's rays leave its
// lighting stage. -DCLEAN_VIS_QUEUE -DCLEAN_VIS_QUEUE_M2 (M2: the GI hits' default, the RT reflections' with
