// LLCleanRendererVK::recordProjStoch): the generic core's kernel (CLEAN_SHADOW_STAGE 0, 255 registers)
// as kernels over a per-texel SELECTION DESCRIPTOR (set 3 binding 26, 64 B per denoiser texel) and
// the light samples' JOBS + VISIBILITIES (binding 27, 8 B per sample slot):
//   1 SELECT  the receiver, the candidates (light grid / cluster walk, the emitters), the ReSTIR DI
//             reservoir reuse + its store, the split lights, the occlusion probe, the dense window
//             -> the descriptor (what the sample list is, and which samples have light: their terms
