//     probes): a BLOCKED ray sets B (claiming the patch), a VISIBLE one (any channel > OCC_VIS_MIN:
//     tinted glass counts) sets V where the light has a count -- one atomicOr at most per ray;
//   * the RESOLVE (mode 8 of the emissive build kernel, before pass 15 each ReSTIR frame, one invocation
//     per patch): per light with a count or a note, its index remapped, then V -> count 0 (RE-ADMITTED:
//     one visible ray anywhere in the patch), else B -> count + 1 (saturating at 15), else held; notes
//     cleared. A patch without a note for OCC_AGE_MAX frames (off screen) or without any count is freed.
//   * CULLED = count >= OCC_N (8 traced frames, not one visible ray from the whole patch): its bit 3, one
