//     frame, so each is re-tested every few frames per patch; detection only, never in an estimate. A door
//     opening (or a light swinging into view) re-admits a light within a few frames.
// Stable: a light is culled only after OCC_N frames of all-blocked evidence over the whole patch and
// re-admitted only on a visible ray, so a partly visible patch (a pillar's shadow, a light's own shadow
