// 12 counts dropped with their light (gone from the list).
// (#1052) THE SOFT CULL (RenderVKReSTIROcclusionCull 1, the default; 2 = the rules above, RS_F_OCC_HARD).
// The first cull showed blocky dark rectangles with a thin outline fixed to surfaces (snow, an avatar
