        //  rigged face that reached the TLAS on a pass-A slot BLAS -- a worn ANIMESH whose control avatar has no skin
        //  slot this frame -- is its BIND-POSE mesh at the object's matrix, not where the animesh is drawn. Listed,
        //  its emissive faces lit the floor around the wearer in the animesh's shape, unseen by every mover ray: the
        //  owner's bright animesh-shaped hole in the avatar's shadow, 2026-11-11)
